    "k1198": "[87] TIME, “Exclusive: Anthropic Drops Flagship Safety Pledge,” 24 febbraio 2026: <a href=\"https://time.com/7380854/exclusive-anthropic-drops-flagship-safety-pledge/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">copertura di TIME</a>.",
    "k1199": "[88] Anthropic, “Responsible Scaling Policy Version 3.0,” feb 2026 — <a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/responsible-scaling-policy-v3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">anthropic.com</a>",
    "k1200": "[89] OpenAI, “Our structure,” aggiornato dopo la ricapitalizzazione dell'ottobre 2025 — <a href=\"https://openai.com/our-structure/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openai.com</a>",
    "k1201": "[90] The Conversation via Business Standard, “OpenAI drops ‘safely’ from mission as new structure tests AI's loyalties,” 15 febbraio 2026: <a href=\"https://www.business-standard.com/technology/tech-news/openai-drops-safely-from-mission-as-new-structure-tests-ai-s-loyalties-126021500074_1.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">commento sulla formulazione della missione</a>. La sua inferenza dalla quota azionaria al controllo non dovrebbe essere utilizzata; vedere i diritti di governance di OpenAI in [89].",
    "k1202": "[91] Infosecurity Magazine, “OpenAI, Microsoft, Google and Anthropic Form Body to Regulate AI,” lug 2023 — <a href=\"https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/openai-microsoft-google-anthropic/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">infosecurity-magazine.com</a>",
    "k1203": "[92] The Verge, “The AI Superintelligence Slowdown,” copertura continua aggiornata a ottobre 2026: <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/996923/ai-safety-slow-openai-anthropic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">copertura di The Verge</a>. Per il rapporto sull'incidente del 9 ottobre, vedere la fonte primaria [98].",
